      "subtitles": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 8.52,
          "relative_start": 0.0,
          "relative_end": 8.52,
          "en": "When we met two weeks ago, I think the way we, as a committee, described the labor side of the mandators, we said labor markets are steady.",
          "zh": "两周前开会时，委员会认为劳动力市场稳定。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "劳动力市场稳定"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "labor markets are steady"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "start": 8.52,
          "end": 11.96,
          "relative_start": 8.52,
          "relative_end": 11.96,
          "en": "We said the demand side of the economy was solid.",
          "zh": "需求侧表现稳健。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "需求侧表现稳健"
          ],
          "en_highlights": []
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "start": 11.96,
          "end": 16.12,
          "relative_start": 11.96,
          "relative_end": 16.12,
          "en": "And we said the supply side of the economy, especially CapEx and productivity.",
          "zh": "供给侧，尤其是资本支出和生产率，表现强劲。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "供给侧"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "supply side"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 16.12,
          "end": 20.28,
          "relative_start": 16.12,
          "relative_end": 20.28,
          "en": "Again, this is before we see the fruits of AI. We said that was strong.",
          "zh": "这是在AI成果显现之前，我们就认为强劲。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "AI成果"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "fruits of AI"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 27.12,
          "relative_start": 20.28,
          "relative_end": 27.12,
          "en": "I don't want to sound like a Wall Street newsletter and update that with recent events because we follow trends.",
          "zh": "我不想像华尔街简报那样，用近期事件更新观点，我们关注趋势。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "关注趋势"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "follow trends"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "start": 27.24,
          "end": 31.52,
          "relative_start": 27.24,
          "relative_end": 31.52,
          "en": "And, you know, I'll reinforce something that President Lagarde just said.",
          "zh": "我要重申拉加德行长的话。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "拉加德行长"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "President Lagarde"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "start": 31.52,
          "end": 35.68,
          "relative_start": 31.52,
          "relative_end": 35.68,
          "en": "We're on the price stability business. That might not be our only business.",
          "zh": "我们的核心任务是物价稳定，尽管不是唯一任务。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "物价稳定"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "price stability"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "start": 35.68,
          "end": 41.24,
          "relative_start": 35.68,
          "relative_end": 41.24,
          "en": "But if there was a common thing I heard over the last couple of days, it was open-mindedness on these questions of AI.",
          "zh": "过去几天我听到的共同点是，对AI问题持开放态度。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "开放态度"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "open-mindedness"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "start": 41.24,
          "end": 49.6,
          "relative_start": 41.24,
          "relative_end": 49.6,
          "en": "Open-mindedness on productivity. But we've all looked around and we've seen the prices are too high and I don't think I'm the only one on this stage",
          "zh": "对生产率也持开放态度。但我们都看到物价过高，我相信不止我一人。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "物价过高"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "prices are too high"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "start": 49.6,
          "end": 56.04,
          "relative_start": 49.6,
          "relative_end": 56.04,
          "en": "that's recommitted to deliver price stability. So the market was right to interpret your first news conference as hawkish?",
          "zh": "重新承诺实现物价稳定。所以市场认为你的首次记者会偏鹰派是正确的？",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "物价稳定"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "price stability"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "start": 56.96,
          "end": 66.44,
          "relative_start": 56.96,
          "relative_end": 66.44,
          "en": "Nice try. Yeah, I've just got an advice from a senior statesman on this group not to do that.",
          "zh": "问得好。有位资深政要建议我不要那样做。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "问得好",
            "建议我不要那样做"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "Nice try",
            "not to do that"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 12,
          "start": 66.44,
          "end": 75.28,
          "relative_start": 66.44,
          "relative_end": 75.28,
          "en": "But I'll say this, expectations of inflation over the first four weeks of this period,",
          "zh": "但我要说，过去四周的通胀预期已经下降。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "通胀预期",
            "已经下降"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "expectations of inflation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 13,
          "start": 75.28,
          "end": 79.32,
          "relative_start": 75.28,
          "relative_end": 79.32,
          "en": "they've come down, inflation risks have come down.",
          "zh": "通胀风险已经降低。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "通胀风险",
            "降低"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "inflation risks",
            "come down"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 14,
          "start": 79.32,
          "end": 82.84,
          "relative_start": 79.32,
          "relative_end": 82.84,
          "en": "Again, in our business, we don't want to over-determine things.",
